;text-shadow:none !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call strong{color:#16203A !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call:hover{background:#fff !important;border-color:#fff !important;}</style><div class='wsp-hero'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Delaware Estate and Inheritance Tax: What Heirs Owe When Selling</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Delaware</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Delaware Estate and Inheritance Tax: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Delaware Estate and Inheritance Tax sale</li><li>Turn the Delaware Estate and Inheritance Tax offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Delaware House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>This guide covers what official sources say about Delaware estate and inheritance tax.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>Delaware imposed an estate tax only on individuals dying before January 1, 2018; the estate tax was repealed for individuals dying after Dec 31, 2017. (Estate Tax | Delaware Division of Revenue; <a href='https://financefiles.delaware.gov/docs/estate_tax.pdf' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Delaware?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Delaware houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/delaware-property-tax-guide/'>Delaware Property Tax Guide: Appeals</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/delaware-sheriff-sale/'>Delaware Sheriff Sale Explained</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-delaware/'>We buy houses in Delaware</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://revenue.delaware.gov/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Delaware Division of Revenue</a></li><li><a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Delaware Code</a></li><li><a href='https://courts.delaware.gov/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Delaware Courts</a></li></ul><p><em>General information for Delaware Estate and Inheritance Tax, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Delaware\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-delaware/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Delaware Estate and Inheritance Tax\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/delaware-estate-tax/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "Delaware Estate and Inheritance Tax", "rank_math_description": "Delaware estate and inheritance tax rules and how they affect heirs selling an inherited house. Official sources only.", "rank_math_focus_keyword": "delaware estate tax"}, {"slug": "delaware-sheriff-sale", "title": "Delaware Sheriff Sales: Foreclosure Sale Steps and Redemption", "content": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>.wsp-hero{position:relative;margin:0 calc(-50vw + 50%);padding:5rem 1.5rem;background-image:none;background:linear-gradient(170deg,#12293f 0%,#0c1c2e 46%,#060c16 100%);overflow:hidden;}.wsp-hero-inner{max-width:1216px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:center;}.wsp-hero-left{text-align:center;}.wsp-hero-left h1{color:#fff;font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 1rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3);}.wsp-hero-left h2{color:#fff;font-weight:300;font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 1rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3);}.wsp-hero-left p{color:#fff;font-size:1rem;font-weight:300;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3);}.wsp-btn-outline{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border:2px solid #fff;border-radius:30px;padding:.6rem 1.4rem;font-weight:600;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:.95rem;}.wsp-btn-outline:hover{background:#fff;color:#1A202C;}.wsp-hero-right iframe{width:100%;min-height:560px;border:none;border-radius:4px;}.wsp-wrap{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:3rem 1.5rem 4rem;}@media (max-width:900px){.wsp-hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.wsp-hero-left h1{font-size:2.1rem;}}.wsp-wrap h3{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #3182CE;border-radius:8px;padding:.9rem 1.25rem;margin:1.75rem 0 0;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:#1A202C;}.wsp-wrap h3+p{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin:0 0 .25rem;color:#444;}.wsp-wrap table td{vertical-align:top;}.chb-cta p{margin:0}.wsp-related{margin:2.5rem 0 1rem}.wsp-related h2{font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:1rem;font-weight:600;}.wsp-related-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:1rem;}.wsp-related-card{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;}.wsp-related-card a{font-weight:700;color:var(--global-palette1, #3182CE);text-decoration:none;}.wsp-related-card a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.wsp-related-card p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem;color:#555;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call{background:#E0A83C !important;border:2px solid #E0A83C !important;color:#16203A !important;font-size:1.25rem !important;font-weight:800 !important;padding:1rem 2.2rem !important;border-radius:40px !important;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(224,168,60,.25),0 8px 26px rgba(224,168,60,.5) !important;text-shadow:none !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call strong{color:#16203A !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call:hover{background:#fff !important;border-color:#fff !important;}</style><div class='wsp-hero'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Delaware Sheriff Sales: Foreclosure Sale Steps and Redemption</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Delaware</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Delaware Sheriff Sales: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Delaware Sheriff Sales sale</li><li>Turn the Delaware Sheriff Sales offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Delaware House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>This guide covers Delaware foreclosure sales according to official sources.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>A purchaser at a sheriff&#x27;s sale under a mortgage scire facias holds the property free of the mortgagor&#x27;s equity of redemption and incumbrances. (10 Del. C. \u00a7 5066; <a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/title10/c049/sc11/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>No judgment may be entered, and no covered owner-occupied 1-4 family residence sold at sheriff&#x27;s sale, unless the plaintiff has filed the loss-mitigation affidavit. (10 Del. C. \u00a7 5062A(b); <a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/title10/c049/sc11/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Seller disclosure law does not apply to transfers by sheriff&#x27;s sale for default on a mortgage, judgment, tax or other lien. (6 Del. C. \u00a7 2577(4); <a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/title6/c025/sc07/index.html' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Delinquent-tax sales are advertised by handbills in at least 10 public places in the county and a newspaper notice, with sales at the courthouse door. (9 Del. C. ch. 87, subch. IV; <a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/title9/c087/sc04/index.html' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Foreclosure is judicial: the mortgagee sues out a writ of scire facias sur mortgage in the Superior Court of the county where the property lies. (10 Del. C. \u00a7 5061(a); <a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/title10/c049/sc11/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>For owner-occupied 1-4 family primary residences, a foreclosure action may not be filed until 45 days after a notice of intent to foreclose is sent by certified and first-class mail. (10 Del. C. \u00a7 5062B(a); <a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/title10/c049/sc11/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Plaintiff must file a loss-mitigation affidavit before judgment or sheriff&#x27;s sale on owner-occupied 1-4 family primary residences. (10 Del. C. \u00a7 5062A; <a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/title10/c049/sc11/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>An Automatic Residential Mortgage Foreclosure Mediation Program applies to owner-occupied 1-4 family primary residences; a mediation notice accompanies the complaint. (10 Del. C. \u00a7 5062C; <a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/title10/c049/sc11/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>A buyer at the foreclosure sale holds the property discharged from all equity of redemption and incumbrances made by the mortgagor. (10 Del. C. \u00a7 5066; <a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/title10/c049/sc11/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Delaware?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Delaware houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/delaware-property-tax-guide/'>Delaware Property Tax Guide: Appeals</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/delaware-estate-tax/'>Delaware Estate and Inheritance Tax</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-delaware/'>We buy houses in Delaware</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://revenue.delaware.gov/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Delaware Division of Revenue</a></li><li><a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Delaware Code</a></li><li><a href='https://courts.delaware.gov/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Delaware Courts</a></li></ul><p><em>General information for Delaware Sheriff Sales, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Delaware\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-delaware/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Delaware Sheriff Sale Explained\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/delaware-sheriff-sale/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "Delaware Sheriff Sale Explained", "rank_math_description": "Delaware sheriff sale: how a foreclosure sale works and what you can do first. Official sources only.", "rank_math_focus_keyword": "delaware sheriff sale"}, {"slug": "delaware-recording-deeds", "title": "Delaware Recording a Deed: Fees, Where to File and What to Bring", "content": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>.wsp-hero{position:relative;margin:0 calc(-50vw + 50%);padding:5rem 1.5rem;background-image:none;background:linear-gradient(170deg,#12293f 0%,#0c1c2e 46%,#060c16 100%);overflow:hidden;}.wsp-hero-inner{max-width:1216px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:center;}.wsp-hero-left{text-align:center;}.wsp-hero-left h1{color:#fff;font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 1rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3);}.wsp-hero-left h2{color:#fff;font-weight:300;font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 1rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3);}.wsp-hero-left p{color:#fff;font-size:1rem;font-weight:300;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3);}.wsp-btn-outline{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border:2px solid #fff;border-radius:30px;padding:.6rem 1.4rem;font-weight:600;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:.95rem;}.wsp-btn-outline:hover{background:#fff;color:#1A202C;}.wsp-hero-right iframe{width:100%;min-height:560px;border:none;border-radius:4px;}.wsp-wrap{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:3rem 1.5rem 4rem;}@media (max-width:900px){.wsp-hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.wsp-hero-left h1{font-size:2.1rem;}}.wsp-wrap h3{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:4px solid #3182CE;border-radius:8px;padding:.9rem 1.25rem;margin:1.75rem 0 0;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:#1A202C;}.wsp-wrap h3+p{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin:0 0 .25rem;color:#444;}.wsp-wrap table td{vertical-align:top;}.chb-cta p{margin:0}.wsp-related{margin:2.5rem 0 1rem}.wsp-related h2{font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:1rem;font-weight:600;}.wsp-related-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:1rem;}.wsp-related-card{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;}.wsp-related-card a{font-weight:700;color:var(--global-palette1, #3182CE);text-decoration:none;}.wsp-related-card a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.wsp-related-card p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem;color:#555;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call{background:#E0A83C !important;border:2px solid #E0A83C !important;color:#16203A !important;font-size:1.25rem !important;font-weight:800 !important;padding:1rem 2.2rem !important;border-radius:40px !important;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(224,168,60,.25),0 8px 26px rgba(224,168,60,.5) !important;text-shadow:none !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call strong{color:#16203A !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call:hover{background:#fff !important;border-color:#fff !important;}</style><div class='wsp-hero'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Delaware Recording a Deed: Fees, Where to File and What to Bring</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Delaware</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Delaware Recording a Deed: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Delaware Recording a Deed sale</li><li>Turn the Delaware Recording a Deed offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Delaware House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>Deeds are recorded with the county office named in the sources below.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>Each county has a Recorder of Deeds; the recorder may require payment of recording fees once the date of reception is noted. (9 Del. C. \u00a7 9607(a); <a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/title9/c096/index.html' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Each recorded document carries a $5 Housing Development Fund surcharge and a $25 Delaware Cultural Access Fund fee, included in the county assessment fee. (9 Del. C. \u00a7 9607(b); <a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/title9/c096/index.html' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>A recorder may accept electronic documents but must continue to accept paper documents; fees and taxes may be collected electronically. (25 Del. C. ch. 1, subch. V; <a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/title25/c001/sc05/index.html' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Before recording a deed from a nonresident individual or entity, the recorder collects the required tax return and estimated income tax. (9 Del. C. \u00a7 9607(e); <a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/title9/c096/index.html' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Delaware?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Delaware houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/delaware-property-tax-guide/'>Delaware Property Tax Guide: Appeals</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/delaware-estate-tax/'>Delaware Estate and Inheritance Tax</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/delaware-sheriff-sale/'>Delaware Sheriff Sale Explained</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-delaware/'>We buy houses in Delaware</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://revenue.delaware.gov/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Delaware Division of Revenue</a></li><li><a href='https://delcode.delaware.gov/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Delaware Code</a></li><li><a href='https://courts.delaware.gov/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Delaware Courts</a></li></ul><p><em>General information for Delaware Recording a Deed, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Delaware\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-delaware/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Delaware Recording a Deed Guide\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/delaware-recording-deeds/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "Delaware Recording a Deed Guide", "rank_math_description": "Delaware deed recording: where to record, fees and what to bring. Official sources only.", "rank_math_focus_keyword": "delaware deed recording"}]